  "title": "Mailäenderli (Swiss Butter Cookies)",
  "description": "These Swiss butter cookies are topped with festive sprinkles and made for Christmas Eve, but they're so good that you may want to make them year-round!",
  "authors": [
    "Cindy Krafft"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:32:23-04:00",
